      },
      {
        "id": "E2",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "GitHub Agentic Workflows , an open source project from GitHub Next, is now generally available.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://github.blog/changelog/2026-10-28-github-agentic-workflows-generally-available",
        "source": "GitHub Changelog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-28T15:30:15.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-29T16:55:18.295Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E3",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "With agentic workflows, you can automate reasoning-based tasks like issue triage, CI failure analysis, documentation updates, and test writing by using coding agents inside GitHub Actions.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://github.blog/changelog/2026-10-28-github-agentic-workflows-generally-available",
        "source": "GitHub Changelog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-28T15:30:15.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-29T16:55:18.295Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E4",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "Define your automation in natural language Markdown files, and GitHub Agentic Workflows compiles them into standard Actions YAML.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://github.blog/changelog/2026-10-28-github-agentic-workflows-generally-available",
        "source": "GitHub Changelog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-28T15:30:15.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-29T16:55:18.295Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E5",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "We&rsquo;ve been rolling out our agentic developer workflows, and the results are measurable.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://github.blog/changelog/2026-10-28-github-agentic-workflows-generally-available",
        "source": "GitHub Changelog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-28T15:30:15.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-29T16:55:18.295Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E6",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "One of our leads saved an estimated 29 hours a week on his development work alone.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://github.blog/changelog/2026-10-28-github-agentic-workflows-generally-available",
        "source": "GitHub Changelog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-28T15:30:15.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-29T16:55:18.295Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E7",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "Across his team, measured velocity has more than doubled on average, and AI now authors 91% of the team&rsquo;s commits.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://github.blog/changelog/2026-10-28-github-agentic-workflows-generally-available",
        "source": "GitHub Changelog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-28T15:30:15.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-29T16:55:18.295Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E8",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "With these workflows, the team cut production errors from about 11,000 a day to under 1,000 and drove a technology migration end to end.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://github.blog/changelog/2026-10-28-github-agentic-workflows-generally-available",
        "source": "GitHub Changelog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-28T15:30:15.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-29T16:55:18.295Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E9",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "GitHub Agentic Workflows incorporates layered safeguards for your automation.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://github.blog/changelog/2026-10-28-github-agentic-workflows-generally-available",
        "source": "GitHub Changelog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-28T15:30:15.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-29T16:55:18.295Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E10",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "See the GitHub Agentic Workflows release notes for the full list of changes.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://github.blog/changelog/2026-10-28-github-agentic-workflows-generally-available",
        "source": "GitHub Changelog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-28T15:30:15.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-29T16:55:18.295Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E11",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "GitHub Agentic Workflows is now generally available on github.com for GitHub Free, Team, and Enterprise.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://github.blog/changelog/2026-10-28-github-agentic-workflows-generally-available",
        "source": "GitHub Changelog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-28T15:30:15.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-29T16:55:18.295Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E12",
        "kind": "body",
